{"seq":1,"slug":"gpio-interrupt-system","title":"GPIO 与中断系统","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/gpio-interrupt-system","wordCount":2001,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"gpio-与中断系统\">GPIO 与中断系统</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>GPIO 是 MCU 感知和驱动外部世界的入口，中断则是它对外部事件作出实时响应的机制。两者共同构成外设编程的地基，可归纳为四条主线：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>引脚配置</strong>：通过 MODER/OTYPER/OSPEEDR/PUPDR 等寄存器设定模式、输出类型、速度与上下拉，引脚还可能复用为外设功能</li>\n<li><strong>原子操作</strong>：BSRR 寄存器用一次写入完成置位/清除，避免读-改-写带来的数据竞争</li>\n<li><strong>中断通路</strong>：GPIO 边沿经 EXTI 检测与屏蔽后送入 NVIC，由优先级决定嵌套与排队</li>\n<li><strong>ISR 纪律</strong>：响应流程由硬件自动压栈，软件须遵循&quot;快进快出&quot;并处理好防抖与共享数据</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"gpio-基本概念\">GPIO 基本概念</h2><p>通用输入输出（GPIO）是 MCU 与外部世界交互的最基础接口。每个 GPIO 引脚都是一个可编程的数字 I/O 端口，通过配置其模式、速度和上下拉电阻来适应不同的硬件连接需求。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    PIN[物理引脚] --&gt; PAD[焊盘保护电路]&#10;    PAD --&gt; MUX{复用选择器}&#10;    MUX --&gt;|GPIO| GPIO_BLOCK[GPIO 功能块]&#10;    MUX --&gt;|AF0-AF15| PERIPH[外设功能]&#10;    GPIO_BLOCK --&gt; INPUT[输入驱动器]&#10;    GPIO_BLOCK --&gt; OUTPUT[输出驱动器]&#10;    INPUT --&gt; IDR[输入数据寄存器 IDR]&#10;    OUTPUT --&gt; ODR[输出数据寄存器 ODR]&#10;    OUTPUT --&gt; BSRR[位设置/复位寄存器 BSRR]\">graph TD\n    PIN[物理引脚] --&gt; PAD[焊盘保护电路]\n    PAD --&gt; MUX{复用选择器}\n    MUX --&gt;|GPIO| GPIO_BLOCK[GPIO 功能块]\n    MUX --&gt;|AF0-AF15| PERIPH[外设功能]\n    GPIO_BLOCK --&gt; INPUT[输入驱动器]\n    GPIO_BLOCK --&gt; OUTPUT[输出驱动器]\n    INPUT --&gt; IDR[输入数据寄存器 IDR]\n    OUTPUT --&gt; ODR[输出数据寄存器 ODR]\n    OUTPUT --&gt; BSRR[位设置/复位寄存器 BSRR]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>寄存器</th>\n<th>名称</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>位宽</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GPIOx_MODER</td>\n<td>模式寄存器</td>\n<td>输入/输出/复用/模拟（每引脚 2 位）</td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIOx_OTYPER</td>\n<td>输出类型</td>\n<td>推挽/开漏（每引脚 1 位）</td>\n<td>16 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIOx_OSPEEDR</td>\n<td>输出速度</td>\n<td>低/中/高/极高（每引脚 2 位）</td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIOx_PUPDR</td>\n<td>上下拉</td>\n<td>无/上拉/下拉（每引脚 2 位）</td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIOx_IDR</td>\n<td>输入数据</td>\n<td>读取引脚电平（只读）</td>\n<td>16 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIOx_ODR</td>\n<td>输出数据</td>\n<td>设置输出电平</td>\n<td>16 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIOx_BSRR</td>\n<td>位设置/复位</td>\n<td>原子操作设置或清除引脚（只写）</td>\n<td>32 位</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GPIOx_AFRL/H</td>\n<td>复用功能</td>\n<td>选择 AF0-AF15（每引脚 4 位）</td>\n<td>32 位 ×2</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"gpio-工作模式\">GPIO 工作模式</h2><h3 id=\"输入模式\">输入模式</h3><p>输入模式下引脚通过施密特触发器读取外部电平：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>浮空输入</strong>：无内部上下拉，引脚电平完全由外部决定，未连接时呈现不确定状态</li>\n<li><strong>上拉输入</strong>：内部上拉电阻（约 40 kΩ）使悬空引脚呈高电平</li>\n<li><strong>下拉输入</strong>：内部下拉电阻使悬空引脚呈低电平</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>IH_min</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.7</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>DD</mtext></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>IL_max</mtext></msub><mo>≈</mo><mn>0.3</mn><mo>×</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mtext>DD</mtext></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">V_{\\text{IH\\_min}} \\approx 0.7 \\times V_{\\text{DD}}, \\quad V_{\\text{IL\\_max}} \\approx 0.3 \\times V_{\\text{DD}}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IH_min</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.7</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0503em;vertical-align:-0.367em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DD</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">IL_max</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.367em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">0.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.2222em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">DD</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"输出模式\">输出模式</h3><p>输出模式配置引脚驱动外部负载：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>推挽输出</strong>：P-MOS 和 N-MOS 交替导通，能主动驱动高电平和低电平</li>\n<li><strong>开漏输出</strong>：仅有 N-MOS 下拉能力，高电平需外部上拉电阻，适用于&quot;线与&quot;逻辑和电平转换</li>\n</ul>\n<p>输出速度配置影响引脚的压摆率（Slew Rate）和 EMI：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>速度设置</th>\n<th>最大翻转频率</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>低速</td>\n<td>2 MHz</td>\n<td>LED、继电器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>中速</td>\n<td>25 MHz</td>\n<td>通用 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>高速</td>\n<td>50 MHz</td>\n<td>SPI、I2S</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>极高速</td>\n<td>100 MHz</td>\n<td>SDIO、高速外设</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"复用功能模式\">复用功能模式</h3><p>当引脚用作外设功能时（如 UART_TX、SPI_CLK），需配置为复用模式并选择对应的 AF 编号：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GPIO 复用配置</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>MODER[AF]</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>AFR[AF_NUM]</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>OTYPER + OSPEEDR + PUPDR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GPIO 复用配置} = \\text{MODER[AF]} + \\text{AFR[AF\\_NUM]} + \\text{OTYPER + OSPEEDR + PUPDR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GPIO </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">复用配置</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">MODER[AF]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">AFR[AF_NUM]</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">OTYPER + OSPEEDR + PUPDR</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每个引脚可映射多达 16 种复用功能（AF0-AF15），具体映射关系由芯片数据手册的&quot;Alternate Function Mapping&quot;表给出。</p>\n<h2 id=\"bsrr-原子操作\">BSRR 原子操作</h2><p>GPIOx_BSRR（Bit Set/Reset Register）是 GPIO 编程中最重要的寄存器之一，它提供了无需关中断即可原子修改引脚电平的能力：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>低 16 位（BS[15:0]）：写 1 置位对应引脚（写 0 无效果）</li>\n<li>高 16 位（BR[15:0]）：写 1 清除对应引脚（写 0 无效果）</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GPIOA-&gt;BSRR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>5</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>→ PA5 置高</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GPIOA-&gt;BSRR} = (1 &lt;&lt; 5) \\quad \\text{→ PA5 置高}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GPIOA-&gt;BSRR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">→ PA5 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">置高</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p> </p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>GPIOA-&gt;BSRR</mtext><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&lt;</mo><mo>&lt;</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>5</mn><mo>+</mo><mn>16</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mtext>→ PA5 置低</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{GPIOA-&gt;BSRR} = (1 &lt;&lt; (5+16)) \\quad \\text{→ PA5 置低}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">GPIOA-&gt;BSRR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mclose\">))</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">→ PA5 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">置低</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>相比直接操作 ODR（需要&quot;读-改-写&quot;三步），BSRR 的单次写入保证原子性，即使在中断嵌套场景下也不会出现数据竞争。</p>\n<h2 id=\"外部中断系统\">外部中断系统</h2><h3 id=\"exti-架构\">EXTI 架构</h3><p>外部中断/事件控制器（EXTI）监听 GPIO 引脚的电平变化并触发中断或事件：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    PA0[PA0] --&gt; MUX0[SYSCFG_EXTICR&lt;br/&gt;引脚选择]&#10;    PB0[PB0] --&gt; MUX0&#10;    PC0[PC0] --&gt; MUX0&#10;    MUX0 --&gt; EXTI0[EXTI Line 0]&#10;    EXTI0 --&gt; EDGE[边沿检测&lt;br/&gt;上升/下降/双边沿]&#10;    EDGE --&gt; MASK{中断屏蔽?}&#10;    MASK --&gt;|未屏蔽| NVIC_IRQ[NVIC → CPU]&#10;    MASK --&gt;|事件模式| PULSE[事件脉冲 → 外设]\">graph LR\n    PA0[PA0] --&gt; MUX0[SYSCFG_EXTICR&lt;br/&gt;引脚选择]\n    PB0[PB0] --&gt; MUX0\n    PC0[PC0] --&gt; MUX0\n    MUX0 --&gt; EXTI0[EXTI Line 0]\n    EXTI0 --&gt; EDGE[边沿检测&lt;br/&gt;上升/下降/双边沿]\n    EDGE --&gt; MASK{中断屏蔽?}\n    MASK --&gt;|未屏蔽| NVIC_IRQ[NVIC → CPU]\n    MASK --&gt;|事件模式| PULSE[事件脉冲 → 外设]</pre><p>关键配置要素：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>引脚映射</strong>：每条 EXTI 线只能连接一个端口的同编号引脚（PA0 或 PB0 或 PC0，不能同时选）</li>\n<li><strong>触发边沿</strong>：上升沿（RTSR）、下降沿（FTSR）、双边沿（两者都使能）</li>\n<li><strong>中断/事件选择</strong>：中断模式触发 CPU 响应，事件模式仅产生硬件脉冲（可唤醒 ADC 等外设）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"exti-中断线分组\">EXTI 中断线分组</h3><p>STM32 的 EXTI 中断在 NVIC 中的映射并非一一对应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>EXTI 线</th>\n<th>NVIC IRQ 编号</th>\n<th>共享情况</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>EXTI0</td>\n<td>EXTI0_IRQn</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXTI1</td>\n<td>EXTI1_IRQn</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXTI2</td>\n<td>EXTI2_IRQn</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXTI3</td>\n<td>EXTI3_IRQn</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXTI4</td>\n<td>EXTI4_IRQn</td>\n<td>独立</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXTI5-9</td>\n<td>EXTI9_5_IRQn</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>EXTI10-15</td>\n<td>EXTI15_10_IRQn</td>\n<td>共享</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>共享中断线的 ISR 内需通过检查 EXTI_PR（挂起寄存器）确定具体是哪条线触发了中断。</p>\n<h2 id=\"nvic-优先级管理\">NVIC 优先级管理</h2><h3 id=\"优先级配置\">优先级配置</h3><p>NVIC 支持可编程优先级，优先级数值越小优先级越高：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效优先级位</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn><mtext>（STM32F4 实现）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效优先级位} = 4 \\text{（STM32F4 实现）}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效优先级位</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord\">STM32F4 </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">实现）</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>可用优先级数</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>16</mn><mtext> 级</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{可用优先级数} = 2^4 = 16 \\text{ 级}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">可用优先级数</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">4</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">16</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">级</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>优先级分组通过 AIRCR.PRIGROUP 字段配置：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分组方案</th>\n<th>抢占位数</th>\n<th>子优先位数</th>\n<th>抢占级数</th>\n<th>子优先级数</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Group 0</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>16</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Group 1</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>8</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Group 2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Group 3</td>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>8</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Group 4</td>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>16</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"中断嵌套\">中断嵌套</h3><p>抢占优先级不同的中断可以嵌套执行：高抢占优先级中断到来时，低优先级 ISR 被压栈暂停。设计嵌套中断时需注意：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>栈深度需足够容纳最大嵌套层数（每层约 32 字节自动压栈 + ISR 局部变量）</li>\n<li>ISR 执行时间应尽量短，长操作推迟到主循环或低优先级任务</li>\n<li>共享数据的访问需使用临界区保护或原子操作</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"中断响应流程\">中断响应流程</h2><h3 id=\"硬件自动操作\">硬件自动操作</h3><p>当中断被接受时，Cortex-M 硬件自动完成以下操作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>压栈 8 个寄存器：xPSR、PC、LR、R12、R3、R2、R1、R0（8 × 4 = 32 字节）</li>\n<li>从向量表获取 ISR 入口地址加载到 PC</li>\n<li>更新 LR 为 EXC_RETURN 魔数值</li>\n<li>更新 IPSR 为当前异常编号</li>\n<li>切换到 Handler Mode</li>\n</ol>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>中断延迟</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>压栈时间</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>向量表读取</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>12</mn><mtext> 周期（</mtext><mi>M</mi><mn>3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>M</mi><mn>4</mn><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>零等待</mtext><mi>F</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>a</mi><mi>s</mi><mi>h</mi><mtext>）</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{中断延迟} = \\text{压栈时间} + \\text{向量表读取} = 12 \\text{ 周期}（M3/M4, 零等待 Flash）</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">中断延迟</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">压栈时间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">向量表读取</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">周期</span></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">（</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">3/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">M</span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">零等待</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">）</span></span></span></span></span></div><h3 id=\"isr-编写规范\">ISR 编写规范</h3><p>嵌入式 ISR 遵循&quot;快进快出&quot;原则：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>禁止</strong>在 ISR 中使用阻塞操作（delay、等待信号量）</li>\n<li><strong>禁止</strong>调用非可重入的库函数（如 printf、malloc）</li>\n<li><strong>必须</strong>清除中断挂起标志（否则退出后立即重入）</li>\n<li><strong>推荐</strong>仅设置标志位或写入环形缓冲区，将处理逻辑延迟到主循环</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>ISR 时间预算</mtext><mo>≤</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msub><mi>f</mi><mtext>中断频率</mtext></msub></mfrac><mo>−</mo><mtext>上下文切换开销</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{ISR 时间预算} \\leq \\frac{1}{f_{\\text{中断频率}}} - \\text{上下文切换开销}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ISR </span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">时间预算</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.2019em;vertical-align:-0.8804em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.3214em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3283em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.1076em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback mtight\">中断频率</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8804em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">上下文切换开销</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><h2 id=\"防抖与滤波\">防抖与滤波</h2><p>物理按键的机械弹跳会在数毫秒内产生多次电平翻转，直接使用 EXTI 会触发多次中断：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>防抖方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>延迟</th>\n<th>CPU 开销</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>软件延时</td>\n<td>检测边沿后等待 10-50 ms 再确认</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>定时器采样</td>\n<td>每 5 ms 采样引脚，连续 N 次一致视为有效</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>低</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>RC 滤波</td>\n<td>硬件 RC 低通滤波器消除高频抖动</td>\n<td>取决于 RC 常数</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>施密特触发</td>\n<td>迟滞比较器消除噪声边沿</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>零</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>推荐的软件防抖策略结合定时器中断实现非阻塞采样，每次采样记录引脚状态到移位寄存器，当连续多次采样值相同时确认状态变化。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>引脚配置</strong>：MODER/OTYPER/OSPEEDR/PUPDR 分别控制模式、输出类型、速度与上下拉；复用模式需选择 AF 编号。</li>\n<li><strong>原子写入</strong>：BSRR 用一次写入完成置位（低 16 位）或清除（高 16 位），在中断嵌套下不会出现数据竞争。</li>\n<li><strong>中断通路</strong>：GPIO 边沿经 EXTI 检测与屏蔽后送入 NVIC；共享中断线需在 ISR 内查 EXTI_PR 判断触发源。</li>\n<li><strong>优先级</strong>：NVIC 优先级数值越小越高，通过 PRIGROUP 把位宽划分为抢占位与子优先位，决定嵌套与排队。</li>\n<li><strong>ISR 规范</strong>：硬件自动压栈 8 个寄存器形成 12 周期延迟；ISR 须快进快出、清挂起标志，并配防抖滤波处理机械弹跳。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"GPIO 与中断系统","id":"gpio-与中断系统"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GPIO 基本概念","id":"gpio-基本概念"},{"level":2,"text":"GPIO 工作模式","id":"gpio-工作模式"},{"level":3,"text":"输入模式","id":"输入模式"},{"level":3,"text":"输出模式","id":"输出模式"},{"level":3,"text":"复用功能模式","id":"复用功能模式"},{"level":2,"text":"BSRR 原子操作","id":"bsrr-原子操作"},{"level":2,"text":"外部中断系统","id":"外部中断系统"},{"level":3,"text":"EXTI 架构","id":"exti-架构"},{"level":3,"text":"EXTI 中断线分组","id":"exti-中断线分组"},{"level":2,"text":"NVIC 优先级管理","id":"nvic-优先级管理"},{"level":3,"text":"优先级配置","id":"优先级配置"},{"level":3,"text":"中断嵌套","id":"中断嵌套"},{"level":2,"text":"中断响应流程","id":"中断响应流程"},{"level":3,"text":"硬件自动操作","id":"硬件自动操作"},{"level":3,"text":"ISR 编写规范","id":"isr-编写规范"},{"level":2,"text":"防抖与滤波","id":"防抖与滤波"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"时钟系统与电源管理","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/microcontroller-fundamentals/clock-system-power-management"},"next":{"title":"定时器、PWM 与 ADC","url":"/l-doc-books/h/hardware-electronics/embedded-bare-metal/peripheral-programming/timer-pwm-adc"}}